{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19868","headline":"感怀 · 孟郊","name":"感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孟冬阴气交，两河正屯兵。\n烟尘相驰突，烽火日夜惊。\n太行险阻高，挽粟输连营。\n奈何操弧者，不使枭巢倾。\n犹闻汉北儿，怙乱谋纵横。\n擅摇干戈柄，呼呌豺狼声。\n白日临尔躯，胡爲丧丹诚。\n岂无感激士，以致天下平。\n登高望寒原，黄云郁峥嵘。\n坐驰悲风莫，叹息空沾缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}